    "sourceLabel": "https://github.com/scsibug/nostr-rs-relay README 'Supported NIPs' checklist (mirror content)",
    "notation": "'- [x] NIP-NN: [Title](link)'",
    "fetched": "2026-08-18",
    "caveats": [
     "THE CENTRAL COLLISION: this README lists 'NIP-15: End of Stored Events Notice'. Amethyst's README lists 'Nostr Marketplace (NIP-15)'. Both are primary sources. NIP-15 was reassigned after the original was merged into NIP-01, so the SAME KEY means two different specifications depending on which project wrote it and when.",
     "NIP-12, NIP-15, NIP-16, NIP-20 and NIP-33 were all merged into NIP-01 and deleted from the registry. Five of the fifteen claimed NIPs no longer exist.",
     "'NIP-91: AND operator for filters' links to a nostr-protocol/nips PULL REQUEST (#1365), not a merged NIP. It is a number that only exists in a proposal.",
     "NIP-22 here is 'Event created_at limits' with the qualifier '(future-dated events only)'; NIP-22 in the current registry is 'Comment' — another reassigned number.",
     "'- [ ] NIP-26 (implemented, but currently disabled)' is a fifth support state that none of implemented/partial/planned/unknown captures."
    ],
